comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:11:14.846Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status 2801-item inventory and request-specific searches found no owner for GH-1304. Reuse pm-u9d0 and historical pm-e70zh5. Report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1304"
  "2026-09-25T10:29:42.392Z","harness:codex","Live external inventory: no open PRs; GitHub Dependabot, code scanning and secret scanning each return zero open alerts; pnpm audit has zero advisories. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes: zero recent high/critical Sentry issues (14 days), telemetry finish error rate 1.77%, zero failures missing error codes. Scheduled failure 36111244838 is reproduced by inherited RELEASE_PIPELINE_OUTPUT and covered by explicit test environment isolation. Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.23 is installed and activated; generation follows item closure."
  "2026-09-25T10:30:18.244Z","harness:codex","Dependency inventory 2026-09-25: compatible latest greptile 3.5.4, jscpd 5.3.2, marked 18.0.14 and knip 6.38.0 were published September 22-23 and remain within the seven-day aging policy. Sentry 11.0.0 is also only two days old. Registry peer verification confirms existing major work: pm-do5b (TypeScript 7 excluded by typescript-eslint <6.1), pm-fokyhh (Vitest 5 excluded by CodSpeed ^3.2 || ^4), pm-ksr40d (npm-package-arg 14 requires a higher Node 22 floor than supported). No bypass or duplicate migration item added."
  "2026-09-25T10:39:20.394Z","harness:codex","Freshness proof 2026-09-25 10:37 UTC: live telemetry database latest event was 9 seconds old and 446 events arrived in the last 15 minutes. This proves recent ingestion, not unsampled completeness of every action. The release workflow retains its once-daily UTC tag guard, serialized concurrency and bounded blocker-closure retry; no release-policy bypass was introduced."
  "2026-09-25T10:42:29.985Z","harness:codex","Publication baseline remains distinct from repository version: latest public npm and GitHub Release are v2026.9.23; immutable v2026.9.24 Release run 35973749511 failed. Today scheduled preparation failed before a new tag at exact coverage. This tranche repairs that new environment-sensitive gate; it does not move the prior immutable tag or claim it was published."
  "2026-09-25T10:49:16.707Z","harness:codex","Verification: release pipeline coverage with inherited RELEASE_PIPELINE_OUTPUT reaches 100% statements (197/197), branches (126/126), functions (33/33), and lines (195/195). Packed distribution smoke passed using npx and bunx across nine packages. Sentry has zero unresolved issues; the required telemetry gate passes at 1.77% finish error rate with zero failures missing codes. Live aggregate query observed a newest event six seconds old and 388 events in 15 minutes. These are current aggregate observations, not proof of every user action or publication of v2026.9.24."
  "2026-09-25T11:07:18.541Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all four linked test commands passed sequentially with zero assertion failures or timeouts. Changed-source typecheck and ESLint pass. Hosted exact-head static and full coverage gates remain required before merge; prior full-run failure details were investigated and corrected without relaxing gates."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:32:13.388Z","harness:codex",The verification edges record fresh registry peer/engine checks of the canonical migration deferrals; they do not claim those migrations are implemented.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:29:43.788Z","harness:codex",Release-unit-test environment must delete inherited workflow output and push-token variables before each case; otherwise hosted coverage differs and fixtures can write the production observation file.
